      "updated": 1785172082519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Some Use cases of UDP:\n- WebRTC (Web Real-Time Communication)\n- Gameplay traffic\n- Video Streaming\n- VPN - OpenVPN\n- DNS\n- QUIC",
